        },
        {
          "text": "Na ĩngĩ aseũvya kĩthembeo kya ũthuku, ũasa wakyo mĩkono mĩongo ĩlĩ, na ũthanthau wakyo mĩkono mĩongo ĩlĩ, na ũtũlu wakyo mĩkono ĩkũmi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
